{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797340/extras/3d02fb61bf929ce08bdc8adf70787eb2.avif?t=1770273964\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br>Take on the role of ranch manager and grow your fledgling herd of animals into one worthy of pleasing the Cat God! There are many different paths to choose, but only one hurdle to overcome at the end of each week. Pay tribute to the Cat God or face his wrath and have your ranch be shut down. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797340/extras/c34cbef9b551b538edac4d454cccb81a.avif?t=1770273964\" width=616 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 100 types of animals, all with their own unique abilities</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797340/extras/fa6a101654d6981f3cfaf8cd5c6ad260.poster.avif?t=1770273964\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797340/extras/fa6a101654d6981f3cfaf8cd5c6ad260.webm?t=1770273964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797340/extras/fa6a101654d6981f3cfaf8cd5c6ad260.mp4?t=1770273964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whether it's alpacas, crocodiles, hyenas, larks, or a combination of all, you choose the kind of ranch you want to build.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take advantage of 7 different animal families in the game</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797340/extras/4751fc6ff39a6b3a92e00b6385cd38c0.poster.avif?t=1770273964\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse