mprove on your ranch, the Cat God will bestow you with prop cards. Add these modifiers to your daily earnings and watch them grow!<br><br>With 10+ cat gods, 100+ animals, 100+ props, 20+ toys, 10+ tiles, it's time to build your own unique deck and appease the Cat God!<br>More gameplay is currently in development, so join our Discord &amp; QQ to provide suggestions to make the game better!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bird Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/275aa54bde4bffc270291914eb60dd87523b8938.jpg"},{"name":"Bird God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/6a1df745a9441fbedf94b38a86976dcd4818ac8d.jpg"},{"name":"Bird Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/b9a1b57d89574676ba9a1dad2824e85b0be348f2.jpg"},{"name":"Bird King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/10f1cad9d5ec5e3eb5961bc509321efb65d2469e.jpg"},{"name":"Pokedex Doc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/f00482f46c2d44e3b885bd12c88d4d677cf513da.jpg"},{"name":"Carnivore Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/07cdcfcf4d08f6f6e0acb14ec1af043666ba5187.jpg"},{"name":"Carnivore God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/69c114da4459f9008a5a0a7b139c83b8776de1dc.jpg"},{"name":"Carnivore King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/8f75c38af2db8918a469ca67581ea3ff6c24469c.jpg"},{"name":"Cat God's Child","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/15bb902d107628924f916ee62baf539404fecfd9.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer Cat God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2797340/a91b6420fbf8602df036e9d2aaddb069f52e6d46.jpg"}],"total":75},"backgro